    "answer": {
      "short": "$0.01=\\frac{1}{100}$; $0.125=\\frac{1}{8}$; $0.25=\\frac{1}{4}$; $0.2=\\frac{1}{5}$; $0.5=\\frac{1}{2}$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}0.01&=\\frac{1}{100}\\\\0.125&=\\frac{125}{1000}=\\frac{1}{8}\\\\0.25&=\\frac{25}{100}=\\frac{1}{4}\\\\0.2&=\\frac{2}{10}=\\frac{1}{5}\\\\0.5&=\\frac{5}{10}=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
